    "title": "Memphis Community on Alert After Daylight Vehicle Break-Ins on Chippewa Road - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elena Nguyen ,\n6 hours ago A recent incident in Memphis has left residents of the 3900 block of Chippewa Road feeling unsettled as local police reported a theft on August 22, 2025. According to the Memphis Police Department's website, the incident involved a perpetrator breaking into two vehicles parked in a driveway. This flagrant act was carried out at 4:10 p.m., a time when the streets are still frequented by neighbors and passersby, adding an audacious underline to the event. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
